WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Every Wonder starts when split screens start slowing the table.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
NEXUS-PAN recovers session state when players reconnect.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
ALICE compares runner choices before they become table problems.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
KARMA FORGE previews house-rule impact before approval.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
JACKPOINT turns table events into clean dossiers.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
RUNSITE makes mission spaces readable before contact.

7
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
RUNBOOK PRESS shapes campaign material into books.

8
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
TABLE PULSE turns heat into governed remote reaction packets.

9
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:08.000
BLACK LEDGER lets the world wake up after the run.

10
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Newsreels make consequences feel like the city is watching.

11
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.000
COMMUNITY HUB brings players to vetted open runs.

12
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Every Wonder returns to one table and one campaign.
